# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is ignored by git and must stay that way.
#
# The sidecar calls a model through OpenRouter. The hook inherits the environment
# of the shell that starts the harness, so an exported variable reaches it.
# A missing key is an ordinary error path: the sidecar prints nothing, exits 0,
# and the harness draws the original. See CONTEXT.md, term `fail-open`.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
